     The uuggll driver provides support for Genesys Logic GL620USB-A based host-
     to-host USB connectors.

     The uuggll driver appears as an Ethernet interface and should be configured
     with ifconfig(8) in the same way as other Ethernet interfaces.  It does
     not support different media types or options.

